@startuml
title Goox System Context

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Flutter UI\n(shell + editor widgets)" as Flutter
component "Goox Editor SDK\n(controller + adapters)" as SDK
component "flutter_rust_bridge\n(generated bindings + bootstrap)" as FRB
component "Rust Core\nEditorBuffer + Revision Clock" as RustCore
component "Worker Pool\nhighlighting / search / plugins" as Workers
component "Wasm Plugins" as Plugins

Flutter --> SDK : input events\napp state updates
SDK --> FRB : ordered commands\nviewport requests
FRB --> RustCore : ordered commands
RustCore --> FRB : patch batches\nviewport snapshots
RustCore --> Workers : async jobs
Workers --> Plugins : sandboxed execution
Plugins --> RustCore : validated edit proposals
FRB --> SDK : bridge responses
SDK --> Flutter : render-ready state

note right of RustCore
Single source of truth
for text, revisions,
and undo/redo.
end note

@enduml
